									<br />
									A New Lead has been assigned to you, check the details of the following&nbsp;customer.<br />
									<br />
									<strong>Lead Deatils:</strong></span></span><br />
									&nbsp;
									<div style="margin-left: 40px;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times New Roman,Times,serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>First Name:</strong>&nbsp;{{{Recipient.FirstName}}}<br />
									&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Last&nbsp;Name:</strong>&nbsp;{{{Recipient.LastName}}}<br />
									&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;{{{Recipient.Email}}}<br />
									&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Phone:&nbsp;</strong>{{{Recipient.Phone}}}<br />
									&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Company:</strong>{{{Recipient.Company}}}<br />
									&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Project Type:</strong>&nbsp;{{{Recipient.Type_Of_Project__c}}}<br />
									&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Project Scope:</strong>&nbsp;{{{Recipient.Project_Scope__c}}}<br />
									&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Budget:</strong>&nbsp;{{{Recipient.Customer_Budget__c}}}<br />
									&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Project Desription:</strong>&nbsp;{{{Recipient.Project_Description__c}}}</span></span><br />
									&nbsp;</div>
									<span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"> Thankyou for your response.<br />
									<br />
									<br />
									Best Regards,</span></span><br />
									The Arelia Living Team</td>
								</tr>
